  "details": "We really need an option for the orange status that we can choose between sharing the location + player count of the instance or not!\nGreen Status shares everything and you can freely join and Orange Status kinda blocks everything except Invite Requests.\nWe need a middle thing.\nThat is why we need this option, so we can share our locations+playercount of the instance but still only can recieve Invite Requests.\nSo people can assume what is going on where the friend is and request an invite based on that instead of just guessing and being clueless.",
